Name: Zstandard
Short Name: zstd
URL: https://github.com/facebook/zstd
Version: 1.6.0
Revision: 10da6ba6de05e29169261fa4b68eb99239f770dd
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: src/LICENSE
CPEPrefix: cpe:/a:facebook:zstandard:1.6.0
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Zstandard is a fast lossless compression algorithm, targeting real-time
compression scenarios at zlib-level and better compression ratios.

Zstandard is dual-licensed under BSD-3-Clause OR GPLv2. The BSD-3-Clause
license is used here as it is more permissive.

Local Modifications:
- BUILD.gn: Copied unmodified from Chromium's third_party/zstd/BUILD.gn.  Only standalone
  builds use it; in Chromium, //third_party/zstd is Chromium's own copy.
